the darkness, unlike some steakhouses in this city *cough* Ruth's Chris *cough*. Price Point: Is it more expensive t..."},{"business_id":"kYgMSD2obyOgORgd3RSE_w","review_id":"rx3n4pJIJXfGSWXQtAM-fA","date":"2011-08-21T04:57:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9444571733474731,"text_excerpt":"My family & I had dinner here on a random weekday. Nice restaurant reasonable price for a good quality steakhouse. I love what I would describe as their \"Wall of Fame\" as you walk in. It shows you how much people love Mr John's! Appetizer: 1.) Peppercorn crusted yellowfin Tuna: this was good but the tuna was a little dry and overdone when it's suppose to only be seared rare. 2.) Fried Calamari: we ordered this so my mom could also enjoy an appetizer with us. it really was fried to perfection. 3.) Escargot in Puff Pastry: the escargots were sauteed perfectly in this dish; we really enjoyed the mushrooms as well. My brother said the escargot was one of the best he's every tried. Dinner: We ..."},{"business_id":"kYgMSD2obyOgORgd3RSE_w","review_id":"ANHlJ6d3IJXlSHPYHxS7VA","date":"2015-09-13T02:14:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9391857385635376,"text_excerpt":"I recently dined at Mr. John's with my parents and boyfriend for my birthday, and have to say I was highly impressed. The restaurant is cozy and sleek, with mosaic tiled floors and a dimmed dining room. The entire restaurant smells like succulent steak. From walking in the door we were met with five star service. Our server and server assistant were on the ball, providing us with answers to our questions about the menu and prompt service. I split the Caesar with my Dad (it's large enough to share) for an appetizer. The salad was crispy and fresh, and the dressing was perfectly balanced with the acid from the lemon with the brininess from the anchovy. For my entree I had the filet mignon p..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"kYgMSD2obyOgORgd3RSE_w","photo_id":"ndY9XmCiqQiZaGoUFE8ipw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ndY9XmCiqQiZaGoUFE8ipw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8880731463432312},{"business_id":"kYgMSD2obyOgORgd3RSE_w","photo_id":"lkH60jZDoo4AOdNR5SdBVw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lkH60jZDoo4AOdNR5SdBVw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.885481059551239},{"business_id":"kYgMSD2obyOgORgd3RSE_w","photo_id":"EteMhu1WJZBeQ7NXCGr6VQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/EteMhu1WJZBeQ7NXCGr6VQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8763574361801147},{"business_id":"kYgMSD2obyOgORgd3RSE_w","photo_id":"r190Eu2shNkACpdM38sZrw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/r190Eu2shNkACpdM38sZrw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8686732053756714},{"business_id":"kYgMSD2obyOgORgd3RSE_w","photo_id":"E50K0wmjfwJVFG03neRjRQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/E50K0wmjfwJVFG03neRjRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8518329858779907}]},"notebook_case":null}
